codex
The first execution exposed an adapter-only schema mismatch before any anchor was measured: the enriched sealed diagnostic receipt omits `world_sha256` from each row, while its referenced standing receipt contains it. No physics or search ran for the two failed jobs; the third job may still be exiting. I’m fixing the read-side validation to resolve sealed world digests through the referenced standing receipt, then I’ll restart from the empty/resumable outputs.
